  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"bread-baladi","name_ar":"عيش بلدي","name_en":"Baladi bread, whole-wheat pita proxy","category":"carb","state":"ready_to_eat","calories_kcal_per_100g":262,"protein_g_per_100g":9.8,"carbs_g_per_100g":55.89,"fat_g_per_100g":1.71,"fiber_g_per_100g":6.1,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"USDA SR Legacy 2018-04, fdc_id 174916: Bread, pita, whole-wheat. https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/174916/nutrients . All nutrition per 100 g edible food. Whole-wheat pita proxy. 100 g is an app loaf convention, not a universal bakery weight. Published subsidized-loaf example is 90 g: https://gate.ahram.org.eg/News/4956477.aspx . Weigh actual loaf. Assumed portions are explicit app serving conventions, not measured population means. QA correction/review 2026-10-31 (prior provenance retained as history, superseded where changed): portions: [{\"name_ar\": \"رغيف\", \"weight_g\": 100, \"is_default\": true, \"basis\": \"Assumed household portion: existing seed loaf 100 g retained within requested 80 to 110 g range; weigh actual serving\"}, {\"name_ar\": \"نص رغيف\", \"weight_g\": 50, \"is_default\": false, \"basis\": \"Half of assumed 100 g baladi loaf\"}] -> [{\"name_ar\": \"رغيف بلدي مدعم - وزن مرجعي\", \"weight_g\": 90, \"is_default\": true, \"basis\": \"Ministry spokesperson quotation, 25 October 2026: subsidized loaf 90 g; ordinary default for this loaf type, not every free-market loaf. https://www.alwafd.news/5987906\"}, {\"name_ar\": \"نص رغيف بلدي مدعم\", \"weight_g\": 45, \"is_default\": false, \"basis\": \"Half of cited subsidized 90 g loaf = 45 g. https://www.alwafd.news/5987906\"}, {\"name_ar\": \"رغيف بلدي كبير موزون ١٠٠ جرام\", \"weight_g\": 100, \"is_default\": false, \"basis\": \"Previous app convention retained only as explicitly weighed serving; no claim this is the subsidized-loaf standard. https://www.alwafd.news/5987906\"}, {\"name_ar\": \"نص رغيف كبير موزون ٥٠ جرام\", \"weight_g\": 50, \"is_default\": false, \"basis\": \"Half of explicitly weighed 100 g convention retained; subsidized half-loaf default is 45 g. https://www.alwafd.news/5987906\"}]. Replace an ambiguous or doubtful household measure with a named source-based size; additional sizes are explicit. Source: https://www.alwafd.news/5987906. QA review: retained protein_g_per_100g=9.8; other source reports 7.595680000000001; An actual Egyptian baladi control was used, not UK sliced bread. The paper reports protein 11.60, fat 1.62, crude fibre 1.65 and carbohydrate 83.63 on dry matter, with moisture 34.52%. Multiply by 0.6548. Our comparator carbohydrate adds crude fibre back to approximate total carbohydrate. Crude fibre is NOT total dietary fibre; the seed 6.1 g fibre remains independently unresolved. Calculated energy is an estimate, not published calorimetry. Source: Egyptian baladi control, 82% extraction wheat; dry-to-as-eaten conversion; kcal calculated; total dietary fibre unavailable; custom:baladi; https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-023-48686-1; read 2026-10-31. QA unresolved: fiber_g_per_100g, retained original 6.1; comparator None; Independent total-dietary-fibre evidence absent or circular; retain primary/fallback value, do not turn missing evidence into zero. Source: Egyptian baladi control, 82% extraction wheat; dry-to-as-eaten conversion; kcal calculated; total dietary fibre unavailable; custom:baladi; https://www.nature.com/articles/s41598-023-48686-1; read 2026-10-31.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["egyptian_proxy","portion_assumed","second_source_differs","needs_second_source","changed_after_qa"],"usda_fdc_id":174916,"is_verified":false,"entry_basis":"per_100g","is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"رغيف بلدي مدعم - وزن مرجعي","weight_g":90,"is_default":true},{"name_ar":"نص رغيف بلدي مدعم","weight_g":45,"is_default":false},{"name_ar":"رغيف بلدي كبير موزون ١٠٠ جرام","weight_g":100,"is_default":false},{"name_ar":"نص رغيف كبير موزون ٥٠ جرام","weight_g":50,"is_default":false}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"خبز بلدي"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"عيش اسمر بلدي"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"baladi bread"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"aish baladi"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"Egyptian whole wheat flatbread"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"نشويات"}],"nutrients":[{"code":"sugars","amount_per_100g":2.87},{"code":"saturated_fat","amount_per_100g":0.208},{"code":"sodium","amount_per_100g":421},{"code":"calcium","amount_per_100g":15},{"code":"iron","amount_per_100g":3.06},{"code":"potassium","amount_per_100g":170},{"code":"vitamin_c","amount_per_100g":0}]},
