  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mahalabiya","name_ar":"مهلبية","name_en":"Mahalabiya, served milk pudding","category":"composite","state":"ready_to_eat","calories_kcal_per_100g":203,"protein_g_per_100g":6.2,"carbs_g_per_100g":31.6,"fat_g_per_100g":7.3,"fiber_g_per_100g":1.2,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Hoteit et al. 2021 Table 2, regional proxy Mouhallabiya: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7931253/ ; fibre from Hoteit et al. 2023 preprint Table 1/2, same food sampling series: https://assets-eu.researchsquare.com/files/rs-2633237/v1/43f8ee5a-9415-4ab0-8d1f-298c0d8c3e7f.pdf?c=1679928302 . Sweet milk-starch pudding; regional restaurant-style composition is a proxy for Egyptian dessert. Nuts and cream quantities vary. Lebanese preparation is a proxy for Egyptian restaurant food; no ingredient reconstruction. Preprint fibre measurements need independent confirmation. Serving weight is an explicit collector assumption unless a portion basis states otherwise.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["recipe_varies","egyptian_proxy","regional_composition","preprint_fiber","needs_second_source","portion_assumed"],"usda_fdc_id":null,"is_verified":false,"entry_basis":"per_100g","is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"طبق صغير","weight_g":200,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محلبية"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"مهلبية باللبن"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"muhallabia"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"mahalabia"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"milk pudding"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"اكل جاهز"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"وجبة"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"مطاعم"}],"nutrients":[]},
