  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mahshi-vine-leaves","name_ar":"محشي ورق عنب","name_en":"Mahshi vine leaf roll, served","category":"composite","state":"ready_to_eat","calories_kcal_per_100g":102,"protein_g_per_100g":4.4,"carbs_g_per_100g":17.7,"fat_g_per_100g":1.5,"fiber_g_per_100g":6.7,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Hoteit et al. 2021 Table 2, regional proxy Warak enab: https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC7931253/ ; fibre from Hoteit et al. 2023 preprint Table 1/2, same food sampling series: https://assets-eu.researchsquare.com/files/rs-2633237/v1/43f8ee5a-9415-4ab0-8d1f-298c0d8c3e7f.pdf?c=1679928302 . Regional rice-and-meat filling differs from common Egyptian rice-and-herb filling. Higher published fibre retained as reported; it is not USDA total carbohydrate by difference. Lebanese preparation is a proxy for Egyptian restaurant food; no ingredient reconstruction. Preprint fibre measurements need independent confirmation.","confidence":"low","review_flags":["recipe_varies","egyptian_proxy","regional_composition","preprint_fiber","needs_second_source","filling_varies"],"usda_fdc_id":null,"is_verified":false,"entry_basis":"per_100g","is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"صباع","weight_g":16.67,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي ورق العنب"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"ورق عنب بالرز"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"stuffed grape leaves"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"stuffed vine leaves"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"warak enab"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"اكل جاهز"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"وجبة"},{"kind":"search_hint","alias":"مطاعم"}],"nutrients":[]},
