-based size; additional sizes are explicit. Source: https://www.canada.ca/en/health-canada/services/food-nutrition/healthy-eating/nutrient-data/nutrient-value-some-common-foods-2008.html. Fruit-size reference varies by cultivar; use weighed flesh. Source: https://www.canada.ca/en/health-canada/services/food-nutrition/healthy-eating/nutrient-data/nutrient-value-some-common-foods-2008.html. QA review: retained calories_kcal_per_100g=60.0; other source reports 48.0; UK flesh-only ripe mango is lower in carbohydrate/energy. Ripeness, variety, and carbohydrate definition affect composition. A separate Canadian half-mango reference also shows the seed single-fruit default is a large mango, not a safe universal household mass. Source: Mangoes, ripe, flesh only, raw; uk:14-378; https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/60538b91e90e07527df82ae4/McCance_Widdowsons_Composition_of_Foods_Integrated_Dataset_2021..xlsx; read 2026-10-31. QA review: retained carbs_g_per_100g=14.98; other source reports 10.7; UK flesh-only ripe mango is lower in carbohydrate/energy. Ripeness, variety, and carbohydrate definition affect composition. A separate Canadian half-mango reference also shows the seed single-fruit default is a large mango, not a safe universal household mass. Source: Mangoes, ripe, flesh only, raw; uk:14-378; https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/60538b91e90e07527df82ae4/McCance_Widdowsons_Composition_of_Foods_Integrated_Dataset_2021..xlsx; read 2026-10-31.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["portion_varies","second_source_differs","changed_after_qa"],"usda_fdc_id":169910,"is_verified":false,"entry_basis":"per_100g","is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"حبة مانجا متوسطة مرجعية من غير قشر ونواة","weight_g":208,"is_default":true},{"name_ar":"كوب مانجا مقطعة","weight_g":165,"is_default":false},{"name_ar":"حبة مانجا كبيرة من غير قشر ونواة","weight_g":336,"is_default":false}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"مانجو"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"منجة"},{"ki