  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mass-gainer","name_ar":"ماس جينر","name_en":"Mass gainer powder","category":"supplement","state":"dry","calories_kcal_per_100g":377.1281,"protein_g_per_100g":24.2052,"carbs_g_per_100g":61.8912,"fat_g_per_100g":4.2343,"fiber_g_per_100g":3.0333,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"calculated from the unweighted arithmetic mean of three manufacturer labels, each normalized to 100 g dry powder. European available carbohydrate has fibre added to match total carbohydrate; US labels already include fibre. Label-based range per 100 g: kcal 369.00-384.38; protein 15.62-29.00; total_carbs 55.60-73.57; fat 3.00-5.30; fibre 0.00-4.60. Includes oat-based and maltodextrin-based gainers; the wide protein/carbohydrate range warrants low confidence. Do not use for high-fat meal replacements. Optimum Nutrition Serious Mass was cross-checked but excluded from the mean because its EU fibre field is a dash, not zero. Labels: Bulk Mass Gainer chocolate https://www.bulk.com/uk/products/complete-mass-gainer/bble-cmas?pid=11402; Myprotein Impact Weight Gainer brown sugar milk tea https://www.myprotein.com/p/sports-nutrition/impact-weight-gainer/10529988/?variation=12936813; Dymatize Super Mass Gainer Gourmet Vanilla https://dymatize.com/products/super-mass-gainer-gourmet-vanilla; Generic planning profile, not a brand or population-weighted mean. Labels are rounded; flavours and brands vary. Minerals and vitamins left null rather than averaging fortification. Sources accessed/extracted 2026-10-31.","confidence":"low","review_flags":["brand_varies","label_average","label_rounding","carbohydrate_basis_normalized","portion_assumed"],"usda_fdc_id":null,"is_verified":false,"entry_basis":"per_100g","is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"حصة بودرة موزونة ١٠٠ جرام","weight_g":100,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"ماس جينير"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"مسحوق زيادة الوزن"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"weight gainer powder"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias"