  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"kofta-grilled-homemade","name_ar":"كفتة مشوية بيتي","name_en":"Home-grilled Egyptian beef kofta","description_ar":"كفتة لحمة مفرومة بالبصل والبقدونس، مشوية على جريل مصمت مع الاحتفاظ بعصارتها.","calories_kcal_per_100g":264.56,"protein_g_per_100g":17.27,"carbs_g_per_100g":3.91,"fat_g_per_100g":19.84,"fiber_g_per_100g":0.63,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amiraspantry.com/kofta-secrets-soft-juicy-meatballs/ ; https://amiraspantry.com/hawawshi-stuffed-pita-bread/ . Family kofta source recommends 80/20 beef and onion-soaked bread. This smaller all-beef batch uses a solid grill pan to keep nutrient accounting explicit. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. Ingredient proxies are nutrition-only mappings identified in ingredient notes; cook with the named actual ingredient. Dukkah, where present, approximates missing dry spices and is not a prescribed nut addition. \nYield: Five 180 g portions, about four cooked fingers each. Starting 1105 g becomes 900 g after about 205 g moisture loss. All fat and juices are served from a solid grill pan, including the 10 g added oil. This is not open charcoal grilling with fat dripping away; that method needs a separately measured retained-fat calculation. Prep excludes 30 minutes chilling. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"low","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated","ingredient_proxy","fat_retention_assumed"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":900,"prep_minutes":25,"cook_minutes":25,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"طبق كفتة","weight_g":180,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"كفتة لحمة"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"كفتة مشوية"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"beef-ground-20-fat-raw","weight_g":850,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":180,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التقشير"},{"food_slug":"parsley-raw","weight_g":30,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"bread-toast-white","weight_g":30,"note_ar":"توست مفتت يتشرب عصارة البصل"},{"food_slug":"sunflower-oil","weight_g":10,"note_ar":"الزيت اللي داخل في الأكل فعلا"},{"food_slug":"dukkah-dry","weight_g":5,"note_ar":"بهارات كفتة مطحونة؛ الدقة بديل لحساب القيمة الغذائية بس، استخدم التابل المكتوب"}],"steps":["ابشر البصل وصفي عصيره على التوست، وبعد ما يتشرب اخلط الاتنين من غير رمي العصارة.","اعجن اللحمة مع البصل والتوست والبقدونس والبهارات والملح، وبرد الخلطة نص ساعة.","شكل حوالي ٢٠ صباع وادهن الجريل المصمت بالزيت المحسوب.","اشوي على دفعات مع التقليب لحد ما تستوي؛ قدم العصارة اللي في الجريل مع الكفتة."]},
  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"koshari-homemade","name_ar":"كشري بيتي","name_en":"Koshari, homemade","description_ar":"كشري بالرز والعدس والمكرونة والحمص، عليه صلصة وبصل مقرمش. الزيت المحسوب شامل زيت تحمير البصل اللي فضل في الأكل.","calories_kcal_per_100g":156.8,"protein_g_per_100g":4.82,"carbs_g_per_100g":24.2,"fat_g_per_100g":4.68,"fiber_g_per_100g":2.75,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amiraspantry.com/egyptian-koshari/ ; https://www.themediterraneandish.com/egyptian-koshari-recipe/ . Compared grain/legume/pasta balance and onion/sauce methods; scaled to six home plates. Frying absorption is an explicit assumption. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. Ingredient proxies are nutrition-only mappings identified in ingredient notes; cook with the named actual ingredient. Dukkah, where present, approximates missing dry spices and is not a prescribed nut addition. \nYield: Six 400 g plates. Component estimate: rice 600 g, lentils 400 g, pasta 430 g, chickpeas 240 g, vermicelli 100 g, reduced sauce/onions/retained oil 630 g = 2400 g. Of 95 g oil counted, 55 g is assumed retained by drained crispy onions, 20 g reused in rice and 20 g in sauce. Start with about 300 g frying oil; about 225 g remains in the pan after 55 g absorption and 20 g reuse, and is excluded. Do not add reused oil twice. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated","ingredient_proxy","oil_absorption_assumed"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":2400,"prep_minutes":30,"cook_minutes":65,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"طبق","weight_g":400,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"كشري"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"كشري مصري"},{"kind":"alias_en","alias":"koshary"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"rice-white-short-grain-dry","weight_g":220,"note_ar":"رز مصري ناشف؛ الوزن قبل الغسيل والنقع"},{"food_slug":"lentils-brown-dry","weight_g":160,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"pasta-dry","weight_g":180,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"chickpeas-cooked","weight_g":240,"note_ar":"حمص مسلوق ومصفى قبل التجميع"},{"food_slug":"vermicelli-dry","weight_g":40,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":400,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التقشير"},{"food_slug":"tomato","weight_g":650,"note_ar":"طماطم مضروبة أو مفرومة"},{"food_slug":"tomato-paste-canned","weight_g":30,"note_ar":"صلصة طماطم مركزة"},{"food_slug":"garlic-raw","weight_g":25,"note_ar":"توم مقشر"},{"food_slug":"sunflower-oil","weight_g":95,"note_ar":"الزيت اللي داخل في الأكل فعلا"},{"food_slug":"vinegar","weight_g":40,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"dukkah-dry","weight_g":4,"note_ar":"كمون مطحون؛ الدقة بديل لحساب القيمة الغذائية بس، استخدم التابل المكتوب"}],"steps":["اسلق العدس والمكرونة كل واحد لوحده، وصفي المكرونة وسخن الحمص المسلوق.","حمر شرائح البصل في زيت غزير وصفيها؛ احسب ٥٥ جم زيت باقي معاها.","خد ٢٠ جم من زيت البصل وحمر فيهم الشعرية، وحط الرز والملح وحوالي ٤٥٠ مل مية وسويه على الهادي.","شوح التوم في باقي الـ٢٠ جم زيت، وضيف الطماطم والصلصة والخل والكمون وسيبها تتسبك.","قسم الرز والعدس والمكرونة والحمص والصلصة والبصل على ٦ أطباق."]},
  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"lobia-tomato-homemade","name_ar":"لوبيا بالصلصة","name_en":"Egyptian black-eyed pea tomato stew","description_ar":"لوبيا بعين سودا بصلصة الطماطم والتوم، نسخة بيتية من غير لحمة.","calories_kcal_per_100g":86.94,"protein_g_per_100g":4.49,"carbs_g_per_100g":13.05,"fat_g_per_100g":2.25,"fiber_g_per_100g":2.48,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amiraspantry.com/black-eyed-peas/ ; https://www.supermama.me/posts/طريقة-عمل-اللوبيا-باللحمة . Compared Amira’s 270 g meatless batch with the Arabic 250 g meat batch; kept the meatless version with 300 g beans for six smaller stew plates. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. \nYield: Six 300 g servings. Hydrated black-eyed peas about 800 g plus reduced sauce/onion/oil/retained water 1000 g = 1800 g. About 850 ml water is added; retained water includes bean hydration. No liquid is drained after cooking. Prep excludes four-hour soaking. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":1800,"prep_minutes":15,"cook_minutes":65,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"طبق","weight_g":300,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"طبيخ لوبيا"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"لوبيا من غير لحمة"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"black-eyed-peas-dry","weight_g":300,"note_ar":"وزن ناشف قبل النقع ٤ ساعات"},{"food_slug":"tomato","weight_g":600,"note_ar":"طماطم مضروبة أو مفرومة"},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":200,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التقشير"},{"food_slug":"garlic-raw","weight_g":20,"note_ar":"توم مقشر"},{"food_slug":"tomato-paste-canned","weight_g":35,"note_ar":"صلصة طماطم مركزة"},{"food_slug":"sunflower-oil","weight_g":35,"note_ar":"الزيت اللي داخل في الأكل فعلا"}],"steps":["انقع اللوبيا ٤ ساعات، وصفيها واشطفها.","شوح البصل والتوم في الزيت وضيف الطماطم والصلصة وسيبهم يتسبكوا شوية.","ضيف اللوبيا وحوالي ٨٥٠ مل مية سخنة، وخليها تغلي وبعدها وطي.","لما اللوبيا تطرى والصوص يبقى مناسب ظبط الملح وقدمها."]},
  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"macarona-bechamel-homemade","name_ar":"مكرونة بشاميل باللحمة","name_en":"Egyptian macarona bechamel","description_ar":"صينية مكرونة باللحمة المفرومة وبشاميل اللبن والزبدة، من غير جبنة إضافية.","calories_kcal_per_100g":159.54,"protein_g_per_100g":7.56,"carbs_g_per_100g":17.56,"fat_g_per_100g":6.48,"fiber_g_per_100g":0.88,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amiraspantry.com/egyptian-baked-bechamel-pasta/ ; https://www.supermama.me/posts/المكرونة-بالبشاميل . Compared two meat/pasta and roux-fat ratios. Selected six substantial pieces with milk-only bechamel, 60 g butter and 25 g oil, less rich than either original sauce. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. \nYield: Six 400 g squares. Pasta 400 g dry becomes about 960 g, cooked meat/onion/tomato filling about 620 g and baked bechamel/egg/oil about 820 g = 2400 g. Pasta absorbs about 560 g water; milk sauce and meat lose moisture in baking. All 60 g butter and 25 g oil remain; no fat drained. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":2400,"prep_minutes":30,"cook_minutes":45,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"قطعة","weight_g":400,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"مكرونة بالبشاميل"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"مكرونة فرن"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"pasta-dry","weight_g":400,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"beef-ground-10-fat-raw","weight_g":400,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":150,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التقشير"},{"food_slug":"tomato-paste-canned","weight_g":40,"note_ar":"صلصة طماطم مركزة"},{"food_slug":"tomato","weight_g":150,"note_ar":"طماطم مضروبة أو مفرومة"},{"food_slug":"milk-full-fat","weight_g":900,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"flour-white-dry","weight_g":70,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"butter-unsalted","weight_g":60,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"sunflower-oil","weight_g":25,"note_ar":"الزيت اللي داخل في الأكل فعلا"},{"food_slug":"egg-raw","weight_g":50,"note_ar":"بيضة من غير القشر"}],"steps":["اسلق المكرونة أقل من السوا الكامل وصفيها.","شوح البصل في الزيت وضيف اللحمة لحد ما تستوي، وبعدين الطماطم والصلصة والملح وسيب العصاج يتقل.","سيح الزبدة وقلب فيها الدقيق، وضيف اللبن بالتدريج مع التقليب لحد البشاميل ما يتقل.","سيب البشاميل يهدى شوية واضرب البيضة فيه بسرعة.","رص نص المكرونة ومعاها شوية بشاميل، وبعدها اللحمة وباقي المكرونة والبشاميل.","اخبز على ١٩٠ درجة حوالي ٣٥–٤٥ دقيقة لحد الوش ما يحمر، وسيبها ترتاح قبل التقطيع."]},
  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mahshi-kromb-homemade","name_ar":"محشي كرنب بيتي","name_en":"Egyptian stuffed cabbage rolls","description_ar":"كرنب ملفوف برز وطماطم وخضرة، من غير لحمة. الوزن للورق اللي بيتاكل بعد شيل العروق التخينة.","calories_kcal_per_100g":96.71,"protein_g_per_100g":2.02,"carbs_g_per_100g":16.49,"fat_g_per_100g":2.75,"fiber_g_per_100g":2.13,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amwhatieat.com/mahshi-kromb-egyptian-vegan-cabbage-rolls/ ; https://artsandculture.google.com/story/KQVBig0ED6SMQw . Compared Dahlia’s meatless cabbage formula with Nawaya’s Egyptian household filling account. Edible cabbage allocation and gram yield are household estimates; more rice than Dahlia’s one-cup batch. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. Ingredient proxies are nutrition-only mappings identified in ingredient notes; cook with the named actual ingredient. Dukkah, where present, approximates missing dry spices and is not a prescribed nut addition. \nYield: Six 400 g plates. Approximate cooked mass: softened cabbage 1000 g, hydrated rice 1000 g and reduced filling vegetables/herbs/oil 400 g = 2400 g. About 600 ml cooking water is added after blanching and additional moisture moves from vegetables to rice; no nutrient-rich cooking sauce is discarded. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated","ingredient_proxy"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":2400,"prep_minutes":60,"cook_minutes":55,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"طبق","weight_g":400,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي كرنب"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي كرمب"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"cabbage-white-raw","weight_g":1100,"note_ar":"ورق صافي ني بعد استبعاد القلب والعروق التخينة"},{"food_slug":"rice-white-short-grain-dry","weight_g":350,"note_ar":"رز مصري ناشف؛ الوزن قبل الغسيل والنقع"},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":200,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التقشير"},{"food_slug":"tomato","weight_g":500,"note_ar":"طماطم مضروبة أو مفرومة"},{"food_slug":"tomato-paste-canned","weight_g":30,"note_ar":"صلصة طماطم مركزة"},{"food_slug":"parsley-raw","weight_g":30,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"coriander-leaves-raw","weight_g":20,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"dill-raw","weight_g":20,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"sunflower-oil","weight_g":60,"note_ar":"الزيت اللي داخل في الأكل فعلا"},{"food_slug":"garlic-raw","weight_g":20,"note_ar":"توم مقشر"},{"food_slug":"dukkah-dry","weight_g":3,"note_ar":"كمون مطحون؛ الدقة بديل لحساب القيمة الغذائية بس، استخدم التابل المكتوب"}],"steps":["فك ورق الكرنب واسلقه غلوة خفيفة، وشيل العروق التخينة وقطع الورق.","شوح البصل في الزيت، وسبك معاه الطماطم والصلصة.","لما يهدى قلب معاه الرز والخضرة والتوم والكمون والملح.","لف صوابع صغيرة من غير ما تكبس الحشو، ورصها في حلة مفروشة بورق كرنب.","ضيف حوالي ٦٠٠ مل مية سخنة، وخليه يغلي وبعدها وطي النار لحد ما الرز يستوي."]},
  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mahshi-mixed-vegetables-homemade","name_ar":"محشي كوسة وفلفل وبتنجان","name_en":"Egyptian stuffed zucchini, peppers and eggplant","description_ar":"حلة محشي مشكل بحشوة رز وخضرة من غير لحمة. أوزان الخضار صافي بعد التقوير ومن غير اللب المستبعد.","calories_kcal_per_100g":93.97,"protein_g_per_100g":1.82,"carbs_g_per_100g":15.97,"fat_g_per_100g":2.74,"fiber_g_per_100g":1.7,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amiraspantry.com/rice-stuffed-veggies-aka-mahshi/ ; https://amwhatieat.com/mahshi/ . Compared meatless versus meat-and-rice versions; selected meatless. The mixed shell weights replace single-vegetable allocations. Filling capacity and final yield need kitchen confirmation. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. \nYield: Six 400 g mixed plates including any loose filling. Core-free raw shells total 1300 g; after cooking about 1150 g, hydrated rice about 900 g, reduced sauce/herbs/oil about 350 g = 2400 g. Buying weights are rough shopping estimates; excluded cores are not in ingredients or yield. All 350 g rice filling and the 60 g oil are served. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":2400,"prep_minutes":50,"cook_minutes":55,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"طبق","weight_g":400,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي مشكل"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي كوسة"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي فلفل"},{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"محشي بتنجان"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"zucchini-raw","weight_g":450,"note_ar":"جسم الكوسة بعد التقوير؛ اشتري حوالي ٧٠٠ جم"},{"food_slug":"bell-pepper-green-raw","weight_g":400,"note_ar":"فلفل بعد شيل العنق والبذر؛ اشتري حوالي ٥٠٠ جم"},{"food_slug":"eggplant-raw","weight_g":450,"note_ar":"جسم بتنجان صغير بعد التقوير؛ اشتري حوالي ٧٠٠ جم"},{"food_slug":"rice-white-short-grain-dry","weight_g":350,"note_ar":"رز مصري ناشف؛ الوزن قبل الغسيل والنقع"},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":200,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التقشير"},{"food_slug":"tomato","weight_g":500,"note_ar":"طماطم مضروبة أو مفرومة"},{"food_slug":"tomato-paste-canned","weight_g":30,"note_ar":"صلصة طماطم مركزة"},{"food_slug":"parsley-raw","weight_g":30,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"coriander-leaves-raw","weight_g":20,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"dill-raw","weight_g":20,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"sunflower-oil","weight_g":60,"note_ar":"الزيت اللي داخل في الأكل فعلا"}],"steps":["قور الكوسة والبتنجان وشيل بذر الفلفل؛ زن الأجسام اللي هتتحشي بس.","شوح البصل في الزيت وسبك معاه الطماطم والصلصة، وبعد ما يهدى ضيف الرز والخضرة والملح.","احشي الخضار من غير كبس وسيب فراغ فوق عشان الرز يتمدد؛ استخدم كل الحشو.","رص الخضار في حلة وضيف حوالي ٥٥٠ مل مية سخنة لحد قرب آخر صف.","لما يغلي وطي وغطي لحد الخضار والرز ما يستووا؛ لو فاض حشو سويه في نفس الحلة وقدمه معاها."]},
  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mahshi-waraq-enab-homemade","name_ar":"محشي ورق عنب بيتي","name_en":"Stuffed vine leaves, Egyptian home style","description_ar":"ورق عنب بحشوة رز وخضرة من غير لحمة. حساب الورق تقريبي ببديل غذائي لحد ما يتضاف ورق العنب للبيانات.","calories_kcal_per_100g":116.28,"protein_g_per_100g":2.03,"carbs_g_per_100g":19.24,"fat_g_per_100g":3.56,"fiber_g_per_100g":1.63,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Home version adapted and compared from https://amiraspantry.com/rice-stuffed-veggies-aka-mahshi/ ; https://www.supermama.me/posts/محشي-ورق-العنب ; https://amwhatieat.com/meat-and-rice-stuffed-grape-leaves-mahshi-wara-enab/ . Compared markedly different leaf/rice allocations; chose 250 g fresh leaves and 350 g dry rice, not jarred/brined leaf weights. Meatless adaptation with 60 g oil. Weights in grams are this batch's explicit household conversions/adaptations, not claimed source measurements. Nutrition is calculated only from the linked foods and finished weight; no website calorie panel is used. Ingredient proxies are nutrition-only mappings identified in ingredient notes; cook with the named actual ingredient. Dukkah, where present, approximates missing dry spices and is not a prescribed nut addition. \nYield: Six 300 g plates, roughly 12-15 small rolls each but count depends on leaf size. Rice 350 g dry becomes about 1000 g within the rolls, leaves about 230 g, reduced onion/tomato/herbs/lemon/oil about 570 g; total 1800 g. Start with 650 ml water and add small amounts if needed; drain no sauce. Grape-leaf mass is actual fresh edible leaf weight, represented nutritionally by raw cabbage, a weak proxy that understates leaf fibre and energy. Estimated edible finished weight, not measured; weigh the cooked batch to refine the estimate. Water and salt are omitted from nutrient ingredients; their retained mass is included in yield. Side bread/rice is excluded unless listed.","confidence":"low","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimate