  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"mixed-vegetable-soup","name_ar":"شوربة خضار للتجهيز","name_en":"Mixed vegetable prep soup","description_ar":"شوربة خضار للتجهيز بمقادير موزونة؛ الحصة بولة شوربة وزنها 450 جرام.","calories_kcal_per_100g":29.21,"protein_g_per_100g":1.05,"carbs_g_per_100g":4.34,"fat_g_per_100g":1.04,"fiber_g_per_100g":1.38,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Recipe quantities and method checked against https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/versatile-veg-soup (accessed 2026-10-31). Source checks an adaptable vegetable soup, about 500 g vegetables/potatoes to 700 ml stock. Our chunky version uses peas and zucchini instead of potatoes, water instead of stock and no cream; grams and final dilution are planning assumptions. These are planning adaptations, not a verified prescription from an Egyptian coach. Nutrition is calculated only from the listed out/foods-*.json ingredients and estimated finished weight; source-page nutrition is not copied. All edible oil and sauces listed are counted as eaten; no unlisted caloric garnish.\nYield: Makes 4 serving(s): 4 x 450 g (بولة شوربة); finished batch 1800 g. Estimated, not kitchen measured. 1076 g ingredients plus 900 g water, less about 176 g evaporation = 1800 g. Four 450 g bowls with solids divided evenly. Side soup, not a complete high-protein main.","confidence":"low","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated","portion_assumed"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner"],"finished_weight_g":1800,"prep_minutes":12,"cook_minutes":25,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"بولة شوربة","weight_g":450,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"شوربة خضار خفيفة"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"carrot","weight_g":200,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"zucchini-raw","weight_g":300,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"green-peas-raw","weight_g":200,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":100,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"celery-raw","weight_g":60,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"to