  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"oats-dates-walnuts","name_ar":"شوفان بالبلح وعين الجمل","name_en":"Oats with dates and walnuts","description_ar":"شوفان بالبلح وعين الجمل بمقادير موزونة؛ الحصة بولة وزنها 325 جرام.","calories_kcal_per_100g":148.74,"protein_g_per_100g":5.52,"carbs_g_per_100g":21.84,"fat_g_per_100g":4.99,"fiber_g_per_100g":2.53,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Recipe quantities and method checked against https://www.heartuk.org.uk/tasty-recipes/recipe-detail/154-date-and-walnut-porridge (accessed 2026-10-31). Source serves two with 80 g oats plus 20 g oat bran and 560 ml milk, dates and walnuts. Uses its allowed all-oats variant at 50 g per serving, 250 g milk, weighed dates/nuts, and omits honey. These are planning adaptations, not a verified prescription from an Egyptian coach. Nutrition is calculated only from the listed out/foods-*.json ingredients and estimated finished weight; source-page nutrition is not copied. All edible oil and sauces listed are counted as eaten; no unlisted caloric garnish.\nYield: Makes 1 serving(s): 1 x 325 g (بولة); finished batch 325 g. Estimated, not kitchen measured. 345 g input, less about 20 g water evaporation = 325 g, including all dates and nuts.","confidence":"medium","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated","portion_assumed"],"meal_tags":["breakfast","pre_workout"],"finished_weight_g":325,"prep_minutes":5,"cook_minutes":8,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"بولة","weight_g":325,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"شوفان بالتمر والمكسرات"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"oats-dry","weight_g":50,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"milk-low-fat","weight_g":250,"note_ar":"لبن موزون بالجرام"},{"food_slug":"dates","weight_g":30,"note_ar":"بلح ناشف من غير النوى"},{"food_slug":"walnuts","weight_g":15,"note_ar":"لب عين جمل من غير القشر"}],"steps":["قطع البلح حتت صغيرة بعد ما تشيل النوى.","سخن اللبن مع الشوفان، وضيف البلح وقلب على نار هادية حوالي ٨ دقايق.","حط