  {"workspace_id":null,"slug":"tuna-tomato-pasta","name_ar":"مكرونة بالتونة والطماطم","name_en":"Tuna tomato pasta prep bowls","description_ar":"مكرونة بالتونة والطماطم بمقادير موزونة؛ الحصة علبة وزنها 500 جرام.","calories_kcal_per_100g":106.39,"protein_g_per_100g":7.8,"carbs_g_per_100g":14.05,"fat_g_per_100g":1.98,"fiber_g_per_100g":1.02,"origin":"seed","origin_note":"Recipe quantities and method checked against https://www.bbcgoodfood.com/recipes/pasta-tuna-tomato-sauce (accessed 2026-10-31). Source checks tomato-onion-garlic sauce plus drained tuna and separately boiled pasta. Our gym version intentionally changes the ratio to 80 g dry pasta and 140 g drained tuna per box and omits sugar/chilli. These are planning adaptations, not a verified prescription from an Egyptian coach. Nutrition is calculated only from the listed out/foods-*.json ingredients and estimated finished weight; source-page nutrition is not copied. All edible oil and sauces listed are counted as eaten; no unlisted caloric garnish.\nYield: Makes 2 serving(s): 2 x 500 g (علبة); finished batch 1000 g. Estimated, not kitchen measured. 840 g input; pasta 160 -> 400 g after absorbing 240 g water, sauce vegetables 386 -> 306 g through evaporation, tuna 280 g and oil 14 g retained = 1000 g. Two 500 g boxes.","confidence":"low","review_flags":["quantities_vary_by_household","yield_estimated","portion_assumed"],"meal_tags":["lunch","dinner","post_workout"],"finished_weight_g":1000,"prep_minutes":10,"cook_minutes":20,"youtube_video_id":null,"is_active":true,"portions":[{"name_ar":"علبة","weight_g":500,"is_default":true}],"aliases":[{"kind":"alias_ar","alias":"مكرونة تونة"}],"ingredients":[{"food_slug":"pasta-dry","weight_g":160,"note_ar":"مكرونة جافة قبل السلق"},{"food_slug":"tuna-canned-water","weight_g":280,"note_ar":"وزن بعد التصفية"},{"food_slug":"tomato","weight_g":300,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"onion-raw","weight_g":80,"note_ar":null},{"food_slug":"garlic-raw","weight_g":6,"note_ar":null},{"food_